# Requests for the "REST Client" extension of VS Code (humao.rest-client).
# Start the server with `npm run dev`, then click "Send Request" above any request.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Submit a request (expects 201 and a case number)
# @name submit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pqrs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "petition",
  "subject": "Copy of my property tax certificate",
  "description": "I need an official copy of my property tax certificate to complete a bank loan.",
  "requesterName": "Ana Gomez",
  "requesterEmail": "Ana.Gomez@Example.com"
}

### Validation errors (expects 400 with details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pqrs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "other",
  "subject": "Hi",
  "description": "Too short",
  "requesterName": "",
  "requesterEmail": "not-an-email"
}

### Malformed JSON (expects 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pqrs
Content-Type: application/json

{ this is not json

### Anti-bot field filled in (expects 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pqrs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "petition",
  "subject": "Copy of my certificate",
  "description": "I need an official copy of my property tax certificate.",
  "requesterName": "Spam Bot",
  "requesterEmail": "bot@example.com",
  "website": "http://spam.example"
}

### Unknown route (expects 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/does-not-exist

### Look up the request you just submitted (expects 200; the email may use any case)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pqrs/lookup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "caseNumber": "{{submit.response.body.caseNumber}}",
  "requesterEmail": "ANA.GOMEZ@example.com"
}

### Look up with the wrong email (expects 404, the same answer as an unknown case number)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pqrs/lookup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "caseNumber": "{{submit.response.body.caseNumber}}",
  "requesterEmail": "someone.else@example.com"
}

### Look up with badly formed values (expects 400 with details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pqrs/lookup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "caseNumber": "12345",
  "requesterEmail": "not-an-email"
}

### Seeded demo request (run `npm run seed` first; expects 200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pqrs/lookup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "caseNumber": "PQRS-2026-000001",
  "requesterEmail": "ana.gomez@example.com"
}

